libsodium — vendored dependency pin
===================================

STATUS: LOCAL DEV BOOTSTRAP (Homebrew bottle). NOT the shipping arrangement.
        See README.md in this directory and docs/spikes/SP-9-findings.md §6.

Upstream project   libsodium (https://libsodium.org/)
Upstream source    https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium
Version            1.0.22  (upstream "stable" release)
Licence            ISC — see ./LICENSE (verified against the fetched bytes)
Pinned on          2026-10-17

Unlike PDFium (third_party/pdfium/VERSION, SP-1 F-1), libsodium publishes
NUMBERED RELEASE TARBALLS and signs them. So this pin is a real version pin,
not a branch head plus a hash standing in for a version. Both the version and
the SHA-256 are still recorded, for the same reason as PDFium: the version
names what we intended, the hash names the bytes.

